Well there's not a lot I can do really.  It's possible that the
patches themselves didn't apply right.

I'd suggest starting with an unmodified source tree, freshly
downloaded.  Get that to compiling.  Once you have it working, make a
zip archive of the whole tree you can go back to.  Then apply each
patch to the tree one at a time, unzipping the archived source after
each one.  Make sure the patches themselves each individually work.

Making a multi-patch Nethack or Slash'em is certainly not a task for
the faint-hearted....

